          "text": "According to Petitioner (Gregory A. Ott), petitioner Gregory A.\u202fOtt cited Estelle v.\u202fWilliams and Holbrook v.\u202fFlynn as establishing a general rule that some courtroom practices may be inherently prejudicial and violate a defendant\u2019s right to a fair trial."
